# Goal
# Requested close amount in the range (0.0, 1.0].
# 1.0 closes fully. Values between 0.0 and 1.0 close proportionally.
# If the goal leaves this at 0.0, the node may use a configured default close behavior.
float64 close_ratio

# Requested torque to use in torque-mode. If 0.0, the node may use a configured default.
float64 torque

# Optional switch to use torque-mode. If false, the node may still use torque-mode if configured via parameter.
bool use_torque_mode
---
# Result
bool success
string message
---
# Feedback
float32 progress
